#: __init__.py:226
#: addon ui.py:46
msgid "Send the first and final frame to discord for an animation job, or a still image when a still render job is complete complete. Note: the default save location for the preview is set in the addon preferences. if the output extension is openEXR or the size of the frame/still is larger than discord's allowed attachment size (with or without nitro), no preview will be sent."
msgstr "动画任务会将首帧和末帧发送到 Discord；静帧渲染任务完成时则发送静帧图像。注意：预览的默认保存位置在插件偏好设置中设置。如果输出扩展名为 openEXR，或帧/静帧大小超过 Discord 允许的附件大小（无论是否使用 Nitro），则不会发送预览。"

